{'symbol': 'ICE', 'date': '2021-08-17 09:00:00', 'title': 'ICE MORTGAGE TECHNOLOGY ENHANCES ENCOMPASS® PLATFORM ENABLING LENDERS TO STAY AHEAD OF NEW INDUSTRY RULE', 'text': "PLEASANTON, CALIF.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--ICE MORTGAGE TECHNOLOGYTM, PART OF INTERCONTINENTAL EXCHANGE, INC. (NYSE: ICE), A LEADING GLOBAL PROVIDER OF DATA, TECHNOLOGY AND MARKET INFRASTRUCTURE, TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT THE INDUSTRY'S LEADING SOLUTION FOR MORTGAGE LENDERS AND CORRESPONDENT INVESTORS RELEASED ADDITIONAL ENHANCEMENTS TO THE ENCOMPASS® PLATFORM. THE ENCOMPASS 21.2 RELEASE SUPPORTS THE RECENTLY UPDATED GENERAL QUALIFIED MORTGAGE (QM) FINAL RULE ENABLING LENDERS TO SEAMLESSLY CALCULATE ELIGI"}